"Hello, and thanks for joining. I'm reading this from the notch, right under the camera, so my eyes stay where they should.\n\nThe words move at a steady pace, and I can speed them up or slow them down with the arrow keys. Space pauses, and Escape closes the Prompter.\n\nThis window is hidden from screen sharing and recordings, so only I can see it. Everyone else just sees me looking at them.\n\nIn Voice mode the script follows me instead. I read at my own speed, Scout listens on this Mac, and the text keeps up with what I say. If I skip a line, it finds my place again.\n\nThat's all there is to it. Write your own script, press Start, and look into the lens." = "Bonġu u grazzi talli ingħaqadtu. Qed naqra dan min-notch, eżatt taħt il-kamera, għalhekk għajnejja jibqgħu fejn għandhom.\n\nL-kliem jiċċaqlaq b'ritmu kostanti, u nista' nħaffifhom jew inbaxxihom bit-tasti tal-vleġeġ. Space iwaqqafhom, u Escape jagħlaq il-Prompter.\n\nDin it-tieqa hija moħbija mill-qsim tal-iskrin u mir-reġistrazzjonijiet, allura jarawha biss jien. Kulħadd ieħor jara biss li qed inħares lejhom.\n\nF'modalità Leħen l-iscript isegwini jien. Naqra bil-pass tiegħi, Scout jisma' fuq dan il-Mac, u t-test jimxi ma' dak li ngħid. Jekk inqabbeż linja, isib il-post tiegħi mill-ġdid.\n\nDak hu. Ikteb l-iscript tiegħek, agħfas Ibda, u ħares lejn il-lenti.";
