"The %@ uses the camera, so it never opens by itself" = "%@ juża l-kamera, għalhekk qatt ma jinfetaħ waħdu";
"The + at the left of the notch's top row starts a tab in a folder you pick: your login shell goes to the folder, then runs the command, so your PATH and the agent's own sign-in apply. Each tab is a widget on the dashboard that opens into its terminal, and it keeps running while the notch is closed. After Scout restarts the tabs come back by themselves, each in its folder, and the agents continue with the resume command; with that switched off they wait under + › Resume instead." = "Il-+ fix-xellug tal-ewwel ringiela tan-notch jibda tab f'folder li tagħżel: il-login shell tiegħek imur fil-folder, imbagħad iħaddem il-kmand, għalhekk japplikaw il-PATH tiegħek u l-login tal-aġent stess. Kull tab huwa widget fuq id-dashboard li jinfetaħ fit-terminal tiegħu u jibqa' jaħdem waqt li n-notch ikun magħluq. Wara li Scout jerġa' jibda, it-tabs jirritornaw waħedhom, kull wieħed fil-folder tiegħu, u l-aġenti jkomplu bil-kmand ta' kompli; meta dan ikun mitfi, jistennew taħt + › Kompli.";
"The 8-bit look, light or dark, colours, sizes and styles." = "Id-dehra 8-bit, ċara jew skura, kuluri, daqsijiet u stili.";
"The 90s look: pixel agents, chunky keys, LCD digits." = "Id-dehra tad-disgħinijiet: aġenti tal-pixels, tasti oħxon, ċifri LCD.";
"The Mirror widget. Video never leaves your Mac." = "Il-widget tal-Mera. Il-vidjo qatt ma jħalli l-Mac tiegħek.";
"The Prompter sits right under the camera and is hidden from screen sharing and recordings. Steady scrolls at a set speed: ↑ and ↓ (or scrolling) change it, Space pauses, Esc closes." = "Il-Prompter jinsab eżatt taħt il-kamera u moħbi mill-qsim tal-iskrin u mir-reġistrazzjonijiet. Kostanti jiskrollja b'veloċità stabbilita: ↑ u ↓ (jew skrolling) ibiddluha, Space iwaqqaf, Esc jagħlaq.";
"The archive is too big for a ZIP file (4 GB limit)" = "L-arkivju huwa kbir wisq għal fajl ZIP (limitu ta' 4 GB)";
"The camera runs only while the Mirror tab or widget is on screen. The camera key under the picture copies a picture of it to the clipboard; Share makes a polaroid with your agents and shows it before anything is shared. macOS asks for camera access the first time you press the button to turn it on. External and iPhone cameras show up in the list." = "Il-kamera taħdem biss waqt li t-tab jew il-widget tal-Mera jkun fuq l-iskrin. Il-buttuna tal-kamera taħt l-istampa tikkopja stampa tagħha fil-clipboard; Aqsam jagħmel polaroid mal-aġenti tiegħek u juriha qabel ma jinqasam xi ħaġa. macOS jistaqsi għall-aċċess għall-kamera l-ewwel darba li tagħfas il-buttuna biex tixgħelha. Kameras esterni u tal-iPhone jidhru fil-lista.";
"The clipboard history." = "L-istorja tal-clipboard.";
"The countdown appears next to the notch and shows the title when you rest the pointer on it. Zoom, Google Meet, Teams and Webex links get a Join button." = "L-għadd lura jidher ħdejn in-notch u juri t-titlu meta tpoġġi l-pointer fuqu. Links ta' Zoom, Google Meet, Teams u Webex jiksbu buttuna Ingħaqad.";
"The download failed" = "It-tniżżil falla";
"The export failed" = "L-esportazzjoni falliet";
"The folder %@ starts in" = "Il-folder li fih jibda %@";
"The icons along the open notch: click one and it opens; the dashboard tab goes back. They start left of the camera and carry on to its right; the Mirror always stands right of it. The lock key next to the gear keeps the tab you are on as the one the notch opens on, instead of the dashboard; press it again to let go. At least one tab stays on." = "L-ikoni tul in-notch miftuħ: ikklikkja waħda u tinfetaħ; it-tab tad-dashboard imur lura. Jibdew fix-xellug tal-kamera u jkomplu fuq il-lemin tagħha; il-Mera dejjem toqgħod fuq il-lemin tagħha. Il-buttuna tal-lock ħdejn il-gear iżżomm it-tab li int fih bħala dak li fih jinfetaħ in-notch, minflok id-dashboard; agħfasha mill-ġdid biex tħalliha. Tab wieħed mill-inqas jibqa' mixgħul.";
"The model didn't send an answer. Try again." = "Il-mudell ma bagħatx tweġiba. Erġa' pprova.";
"The notch" = "In-notch";
"The notch is alive" = "In-notch huwa ħaj";
"The notch opens on %@. Press to unlock: it opens on the dashboard again" = "In-notch jinfetaħ fuq %@. Agħfas biex tiftaħ: jerġa' jinfetaħ fuq id-dashboard";
"The open notch is as wide as the widgets on your dashboard, up to this width." = "In-notch miftuħ huwa wiesa' daqs il-widgets tad-dashboard tiegħek, sa dan il-wisa'.";
"The open notch is one dashboard: the Agents widget and the Ask AI line are always there, and music, a meeting about to start, a timer, a download, a recording, AirPods and open to-dos show up by themselves while they are live. Click a widget and it grows into its full view; Esc goes back, a second Esc closes. Pinned widgets always show, next to the live ones: pin or unpin them here, arrange them by hand with Edit Nook (or right-click a widget)." = "In-notch miftuħ huwa dashboard wieħed: il-widget Aġenti u l-linja Staqsi lill-AI dejjem huma hemm, u mużika, laqgħa li waslet biex tibda, tajmer, tniżżil, reġistrazzjoni, AirPods u kompiti miftuħa jidhru waħedhom waqt li jkunu ħajjin. Ikklikkja widget u jikber fid-dehra sħiħa tiegħu; Esc imur lura, it-tieni Esc jagħlaq. Il-widgets imwaħħla dejjem jidhru, ħdejn dawk ħajjin: waħħalhom jew neħħihom hawn, irranġahom bl-idejn b'Editja Nook (jew ikklikkja bil-lemin fuq widget).";
